#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "General layout"
msgstr "Uyilo jikelele"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Displaying the interface from the bottom is better if you use a bottom panel instead of the default top bar."
msgstr "Kungcono ukubonisa ujongano ukusuka ezantsi ukuba usebenzisa iphaneli esezantsi endaweni yebha ephezulu engagqibekanga."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From top to bottom"
msgstr "Ukusuka phezulu ukuya ezantsi"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From bottom to top"
msgstr "Ukusuka ezantsi ukuya phezulu"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "The setting could not be saved"
msgstr "Useto alukwazanga ukugcinwa"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Number of emojis per line"
msgstr "Inani lee-emoji kumgca ngamnye"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Size of emojis (px)"
msgstr "Ubungakanani bee-emoji (px)"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Uyilo"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Modifier keys must be between chevrons"
msgstr "Izitshixo zokuguqula kufuneka zibe phakathi kweempawu < >"

#: src/prefs.ts
#, javascript-format
msgid "The default value is %s"
msgstr "Ixabiso elingagqibekanga yi-%s"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Don't use a keyboard shortcut that already exists."
msgstr "Musa ukusebenzisa isinqumleli sekhibhodi esele sikho."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Use a keyboard shortcut to toggle the menu"
msgstr "Sebenzisa isinqumleli sekhibhodi ukuvula nokuvala imenyu"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Isinqumleli sekhibhodi"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This is not a valid keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Esi asisosinqumleli sekhibhodi esisebenzayo"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "List of valid key names"
msgstr "Uluhlu lwamagama ezitshixo asebenzayo"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Always show the icon in the panel"
msgstr "Bonisa isithonjana rhoqo kwiphaneli"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "If you access the menu with the keyboard shortcut, you don't need to always display the icon."
msgstr "Ukuba uvula imenyu ngesinqumleli sekhibhodi, akufuneki ubonise isithonjana rhoqo."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard bindings"
msgstr "Ukudityaniswa kwekhibhodi"

#: src/prefs.ts src/lib/emojiMenu.ts
msgid "Emoji Selector"
msgstr "Emoji Selector"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This extension provides a configurable popup menu displaying most emojis, clicking on an emoji copies it to the clipboard."
msgstr "Olu lwandiso lubonelela ngemenyu evelayo elungiselelekayo ebonisa ii-emoji ezininzi; ukucofa i-emoji kuyikopa kwi-clipboard."

